# Zig 0.17's formatter normalizes every file to LF; without this a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf) rewrites the tree to CRLF and `zig fmt --check`
# fails on every fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated artifacts and vendored binaries stay byte-identical.
*.png binary
*.lib binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.dat binary
*.icudtl binary
